# Tensor-grep index (auto-generated)
.tg_index
# Newer tg writes .tensor-grep/ rather than .tg_index. The OUTER repo already
# ignores this, but a submodule is its own git repo and inherits nothing from
# it, so an index cache generated while working in here was untracked but
# perfectly committable. This repo is PUBLIC — a tool cache must not be able
# to land in it by accident.
.tensor-grep/
_tg_refs/

